<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 1800s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 19th century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 1800s, 1,772 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 550 were founded and 934 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the British Empire, the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland and the Russian Empire.</p></header>
